From b3b62c551a34d3e28664e46a212babb7b7e58f63 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mminin <mminin2010@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:06:02 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] XFA: Turn rotated draws and fields

The rotate attribute was ignored. Designer draws horizontal rules as
vertical lines turned a quarter, and 75 of the 129 corpus forms have
some: unturned, the underlines of CPT121's date fields became 42 mm
vertical bars running down through the certification section, and the
turned column headings of RC4649's tables spilled over its rows.

Lay out a turned draw or field as the box it turns into, about its
anchor point and counterclockwise, both in positioned containers and in
flowed ones, and keep its text in one piece. Draw it unturned in a
matrix that turns it onto that box. Widgets of turned fields cover the
turned box and carry /MK /R, which poppler's appearances follow. Only
multiples of 90 degrees are allowed, as XFA requires.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
